  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cadesa &#x2013; feasibility study for local cocoa processing facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The IA financial contribution supports a feasibility study for the development of a local cocoa processing facility in C&#xf4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire. The project assesses the technical and commercial viability of processing cocoa beans locally. Once implemented, local processing is expected to enable value addition, increase farmer income, and improve resilience of the cocoa value chain. The study will provide a clear view on the viability of the business case and enable future scale-up and investment.</narrative>
  </description>
